{"displayStem":"그림의 전구 RNA는 엑손 세 개와 인트론 두 개로 구성된다. 세 엑손은 모두 유지되고 인트론은 제거된다. poly(A)120nt를 더하며 캡 길이는 세지 않는다. 엑손의 UTR은 번역되지 않는다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"직접 설계한 교육용 모식도·합성 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C06 c06-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 자료 모식도\"><defs><marker id=\"c06arr\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L8 3.5L0 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path></marker><pattern id=\"c06hatch\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M0 8L8 0\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path></pattern></defs><g font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"><text x=\"250\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\">전구 RNA (5′→3′), 길이 비례 아님</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"85\" width=\"100\" height=\"65\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"60\" y=\"124.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">엑손1</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"85\" width=\"100\" height=\"65\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"250\" y=\"124.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">엑손2</text><rect x=\"390\" y=\"85\" width=\"100\" height=\"65\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"440\" y=\"124.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">엑손3</text><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"118\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"118\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"118\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"118\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"60\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\">180nt</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\">240nt</text><text x=\"440\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\">300nt</text><text x=\"155\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\">인트론</text><text x=\"155\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\">200nt</text><text x=\"345\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\">인트론</text><text x=\"345\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\">400nt</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5′·3′ UTR은 엑손에 포함됨</text></g></svg></div></div>"]}